<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97031" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στόνος</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στένω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sighing</i> or <i>groaning</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἔρις ὀφέλλουσα στόνον ἀνδρῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					4.445
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἷμα καὶ ἀργαλέος ς. ἀνδρῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					19.214
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν δὲ στόνος ὤρνυτ᾽ ἀεικής</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					10.483
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				22.308
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στόνον . . ἄκουσα κτεινομένων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					23.40
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διήκει δὲ καὶ πόλιν ς</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				900
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στόνον σαυτοῦ
			ποεῖ</span>; <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				752
			</span></i>; in pl., <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				146
			</span></i> (lyr.); of the sea, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στόνῳ βρέμουσιν . . ἀκταί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					592
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.): rare in Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.71
			</span></i>.</div>
